{"suttaId":"an11.1","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-xi","vriCode":"s0404m4.mul","paras":[6,16],"vripara":"1"},"segments":{"an11.1:0.3":"Kimatthiyasuttaṃ","an11.1:1.1":"[a. ni.10.1] Evaṃ me sutaṃ – ekaṃ samayaṃ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṃ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme.","an11.1:1.3":"Atha kho āyasmā ānando yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkami; upasaṅkamitvā bhagavantaṃ abhivādetvā ekamantaṃ nisīdi. Ekamantaṃ nisinno kho āyasmā ānando bhagavantaṃ etadavoca –","an11.1:1.4":"“kimatthiyāni, bhante, kusalāni sīlāni kimānisaṃsānī”ti?","an11.1:1.5":"“Avippaṭisāratthāni kho, ānanda, kusalāni sīlāni avippaṭisārānisaṃsānī”ti.","an11.1:2.1":"“Avippaṭisāro pana, bhante, kimatthiyo kimānisaṃso”?","an11.1:2.2":"“Avippaṭisāro kho, ānanda, pāmojjattho pāmojjānisaṃso”.","an11.1:3.1":"“Pāmojjaṃ pana, bhante, kimatthiyaṃ kimānisaṃsaṃ”?","an11.1:3.2":"“Pāmojjaṃ kho, ānanda, pītatthaṃ pītānisaṃsaṃ”.","an11.1:4.1":"“Pīti pana, bhante, kimatthiyā kimānisaṃsā”?","an11.1:4.2":"“Pīti kho, ānanda, passaddhatthā passaddhānisaṃsā”.","an11.1:5.1":"“Passaddhi pana, bhante, kimatthiyā kimānisaṃsā”?","an11.1:5.2":"“Passaddhi kho, ānanda, sukhatthā sukhānisaṃsā”.","an11.1:6.1":"“Sukhaṃ pana, bhante, kimatthiyaṃ kimānisaṃsaṃ”?","an11.1:6.2":"“Sukhaṃ kho, ānanda, samādhatthaṃ samādhānisaṃsaṃ”.","an11.1:7.1":"“Samādhi pana, bhante, kimatthiyo kimānisaṃso”?","an11.1:7.2":"“Samādhi kho, ānanda, yathābhūtañāṇadassanattho yathābhūtañāṇadassanānisaṃso”.","an11.1:8.1":"“Yathābhūtañāṇadassanaṃ pana, bhante, kimatthiyaṃ kimānisaṃsaṃ”?","an11.1:8.2":"“Yathābhūtañāṇadassanaṃ kho, ānanda, nibbidatthaṃ nibbidānisaṃsaṃ”.","an11.1:9.1":"“Nibbidā, pana, bhante, kimatthiyā kimānisaṃsā”?","an11.1:9.2":"“Nibbidā kho, ānanda, virāgatthā virāgānisaṃsā”.","an11.1:10.1":"“Virāgo pana, bhante, kimatthiyo kimānisaṃso”?","an11.1:10.2":"“Virāgo kho, ānanda, vimuttiñāṇadassanattho vimuttiñāṇadassanānisaṃso.","an11.1:11.1":"“Iti kho, ānanda, kusalāni sīlāni avippaṭisāratthāni avippaṭisārānisaṃsāni, avippaṭisāro pāmojjattho pāmojjānisaṃso, pāmojjaṃ pītatthaṃ pītānisaṃsaṃ, pīti passaddhatthā passaddhānisaṃsā, passaddhi sukhatthā sukhānisaṃsā, sukhaṃ samādhatthaṃ samādhānisaṃsaṃ, samādhi yathābhūtañāṇadassanattho yathābhūtañāṇadassanānisaṃso, yathābhūtañāṇadassanaṃ nibbidatthaṃ nibbidānisaṃsaṃ, nibbidā virāgatthā virāgānisaṃsā, virāgo vimuttiñāṇadassanattho vimuttiñāṇadassanānisaṃso.","an11.1:11.11":"Iti kho, ānanda, kusalāni sīlāni anupubbena aggāya parentī”ti.","an11.1:11.12":"Paṭhamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Mp-xi","bookName":"Ekādasakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0404a.att","from":709,"to":710,"paras":[{"para":709,"vripara":"1-6","refs":["an11.1:1"],"lines":["1-6. Ekādasakanipātassa paṭhamādīni heṭṭhā vuttanayāneva.","Kevalañcettha ādito pañcasu nibbidāvirāgaṃ dvidhā bhinditvā ekādasaṅgāni katāni.","Chaṭṭhe sikkhāpaccakkhānaṃ adhikaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["an11.1:1"],["an11.1:1"],["an11.1:1"]]},{"para":710,"vripara":null,"refs":["an11.1:1"],"lines":["7-8. Paṭhamasaññāsuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an11.1:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[],"before":[{"para":273,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":274,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Aṅguttaranikāye"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":707,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Nissayavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":708,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["1-6. Kimatthiyasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-xi","bookName":"Ekādasakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0404t.tik","from":779,"to":783,"paras":[{"para":779,"vripara":"1-10","refs":["an11.1:1"],"lines":["1-10. Ekādasakanipātassa paṭhamādīni uttānatthāneva.","Dasame <b>janitasmin</b>ti kammakilesehi nibbatte, jane etasminti vā <b>janetasmiṃ,</b> manussesūti attho.","Tenāha <b>“ye gottapaṭisārino”</b>ti.","Janitasmiṃ-saddo eva vā i-kārassa e-kāraṃ katvā “janetasmin”ti vutto.","<b>Janitasmin</b>ti ca janasminti attho veditabbo.","Janitasminti sāmaññaggahaṇepi yattha catuvaṇṇasamaññā, tattheva manussaloke.","<b>Khattiyo seṭṭho</b>ti ayaṃ lokasamaññāpi manussalokeyeva, na devakāye brahmakāye vāti dassetuṃ <b>“ye gottapaṭisārino”</b>ti vuttaṃ.","<b>Paṭisarantī</b>ti “ahaṃ gotamo, ahaṃ kassapo”ti paṭi paṭi attano gottaṃ anussaranti paṭijānanti vāti attho."],"lineRefs":[["an11.1:1"],["an11.1:1"],["an11.1:1"],["an11.1:1"],["an11.1:1"],["an11.1:1"],["an11.1:1"],["an11.1:1"]]},{"para":780,"vripara":null,"refs":["an11.1:1"],"lines":["Kimatthiyasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an11.1:1"]]},{"para":781,"vripara":null,"refs":["an11.1:1"],"lines":["Nissayavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an11.1:1"]]},{"para":782,"vripara":null,"refs":["an11.1:1"],"lines":["Anussativaggo"],"lineRefs":[["an11.1:1"]]},{"para":783,"vripara":null,"refs":["an11.1:1"],"lines":["1-4. Paṭhamamahānāmasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["an11.1:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[],"before":[{"para":276,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Namo tassa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":277,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Aṅguttaranikāye"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":777,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Nissayavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":778,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["1-10. Kimatthiyasuttādivaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[[]]}]},"tika2":null}
